WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.997
Your data model, as a diagram, saved as DBML files in your repo.

2
00:00:05.047 --> 00:00:07.976
No AI needed, and nothing to configure.

3
00:00:08.426 --> 00:00:12.540
Install ERD Studio, open your folder, and click its icon.

4
00:00:14.826 --> 00:00:17.394
Click New Diagram, and give it a name.

5
00:00:19.226 --> 00:00:21.861
Add a table, with starter columns if you like.

6
00:00:21.911 --> 00:00:24.832
Add another, then link the two with a relationship.

7
00:00:26.426 --> 00:00:30.769
Each table is a DBML file, to commit and review like code.

8
00:00:31.826 --> 00:00:34.595
Export to DBML or Mermaid any time.

9
00:00:34.645 --> 00:00:38.083
Already have DBML? Import it, then keep the draft.

10
00:00:38.826 --> 00:00:41.678
Want grain, keys and the why behind each table?

11
00:00:41.728 --> 00:00:47.145
Click Set Up My AI Helper, then type /erd-studio-setup in your assistant.

12
00:00:47.626 --> 00:00:51.020
ERD Studio is free to use. Install it today.
